WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.850
And he was the wickedest

2
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:13.090
good person I knew, because he just was so

3
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:18.670
real and had a heart, and he
wasn't going to be a fake.

4
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:24.190
And he wasn't going to, you know, be
what other people wanted him to be,

5
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:29.820
someone apologetic, which was
kind of appreciated, really,

6
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:37.850
to have such a raw, honest guy holding

7
